WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 1.7 · Strategic Foundations
Organisational form and identity

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Choose the legal form that fits how your work is funded and governed.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Compare control, surplus, funding and reporting for each option.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Do not pick a form just because funders like it.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Check your choice with qualified local advice.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Riverside Repair Hub (Hybrid · charity with a trading company, United Kingdom)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“A charity runs repair cafés and school work; its own trading company runs the shop and passes profits back.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write a comparison of form options and your current preference.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
